Before starting any task:
1. State your plan in 3-5 bullet points
2. List exactly which files you will create or modify
3. If scope is unclear, ask ONE clarifying question before proceeding

After completing:
- Summarize what changed and why
- List any follow-up tasks created
- Do NOT commit or push
- Do NOT modify files outside listed scope
- Do NOT add features not in the task spec

